/P 251 0 R
/E (We will run a checker Lambda once a day from EventBridge Scheduler. It scans the domains table, opens a TLS connection to each domain with a short timeout, records the expiry date, and publishes certificates inside their alert window to an SNS topic that emails subscribers.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [8]
>>
